// THE RIMEWRIGHT (t 'suncatcher': this was the Suncatcher, and the cold took it off the Sunspire and made it into
// something else). It does not chase. It glides on its own rime at a middle distance and works the floor you are
// standing on: it runs FROST down the hall both ways and leaves the floor slick behind it (jump the frost), it
