// THE GOBLIN BERSERKER. The loudest thing in the valley and the only goblin here with no guard at all.
// He does not circle, he does not block and he cannot turn while he is running - which is the answer to him:
// go THROUGH him and hit the back of him. A swing that finds nothing puts him on his face, and that is the
